D\\rangle_{\\uparrow}\\)</span> (the tuple indexed by a finite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathbb Z\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathbb Z\\)</span> in increasing order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\zeta:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (integer code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_M,\\operatorname{tapecode}_M,\\operatorname{confcode}_M,\\operatorname{runenc}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}_M,\\operatorname{tapecode}_M,\\operatorname{confcode}_M,\\operatorname{runenc}_M\\)</span> (coding maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_3\">\\(\\nu_3\\)</span> (the exponent of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\">\\(3\\)</span> in a positive integer)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{\\mathsf{out}}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(U_{\\mathsf{out}}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (run-output extractor)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}run\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\zeta(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n2i,&amp;i\\geq0,\\\\\n-2i-1,&amp;i&lt;0,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\zeta,\\mathbb Z,\\mathbb N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}run\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\zeta(i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n2i,&amp;i\\geq0,\\\\\n-2i-1,&amp;i&lt;0,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\zeta,\\mathbb Z,\\mathbb N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}run\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\n\\land\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)\n\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\operatorname{supp}_M(T)\n\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\neq B_M\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{tapecode}_M(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{enc}\\Bigl(\n\\bigl\\langle\n\\mathrm{enc}(\\zeta(i),T(i)):\ni\\in\\operatorname{supp}_M(T)\n\\bigr\\rangle_{\\uparrow}\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}run\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\n\\land\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)\n\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\operatorname{supp}_M(T)\n\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\neq B_M\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{tapecode}_M(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{enc}\\Bigl(\n\\bigl\\langle\n\\mathrm{enc}(\\zeta(i),T(i)):\ni\\in\\operatorname{supp}_M(T)\n\\bigr\\rangle_{\\uparrow}\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}run\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall C\\;\\forall q\\in Q_M\\;\\forall T\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C)\\land C=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\n\\to\n\\operatorname{confcode}_M(C)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{enc}\\bigl(q,\\operatorname{tapecode}_M(T),\\zeta(i)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}run\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall C\\;\\forall q\\in Q_M\\;\\forall T\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C)\\land C=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\n\\to\n\\operatorname{confcode}_M(C)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{enc}\\bigl(q,\\operatorname{tapecode}_M(T),\\zeta(i)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}run\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigwedge_{j=0}^{m}\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_j)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{runenc}_M(y,C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{enc}\\bigl(y,\\operatorname{confcode}_M(C_0),\\ldots,\n\\operatorname{confcode}_M(C_m)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}run\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigwedge_{j=0}^{m}\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_j)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{runenc}_M(y,C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{enc}\\bigl(y,\\operatorname{confcode}_M(C_0),\\ldots,\n\\operatorname{confcode}_M(C_m)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}run\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\nu_3(0)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\geq1\\;\\nu_3(t)\n\\coloneqq\\max\\{r\\leq t:3^r\\mid t\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N\\;U_{\\mathsf{out}}(t)\n\\coloneqq\\nu_3(t)\\mathbin{\\dotminus}1,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(U_{\\mathsf{out}}),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigwedge_{j=0}^{m}\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_j)\n\\to\nU_{\\mathsf{out}}(\\operatorname{runenc}_M(y,C_0,\\ldots,C_m))=y\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}run\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\nu_3(0)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\geq1\\;\\nu_3(t)\n\\coloneqq\\max\\{r\\leq t:3^r\\mid t\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N\\;U_{\\mathsf{out}}(t)\n\\coloneqq\\nu_3(t)\\mathbin{\\dotminus}1,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(U_{\\mathsf{out}}),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigwedge_{j=0}^{m}\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_j)\n\\to\nU_{\\mathsf{out}}(\\operatorname{runenc}_M(y,C_0,\\ldots,C_m))=y\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>有限支撑纸带先按整数位置递增排序，再编码非空格位置及其符号；因此\n纸带、配置和有限运行都有规范且可逆的自然数编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}\\)</span>用素数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\">\\(3\\)</span>的指数记录第一个元组分量加一，所以截断后的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\">\\(3\\)</span>-进指数从运行码中统一抽取输出值。</li>\n<li>状态和纸带符号已由上游限制为自然数码；这里没有把函数对象直接塞进\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-tape","status":"resolved","id":"c412569a8bba638b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-tape]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"fb6aa5db0f2eb060","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"1fd20a9a341b65d3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":""